   206	
   207	"It was sawdust," said Lira.
   208	
   209	"It was my floor to walk," said Rooke. "Go on, Cael."
   210	
   211	So Cael told her the fourth, and the sixth burst, and the half stride, a little more than a foot, between where her lead foot came down and where it should have come down.
   212	
