    40	
    41	After that the rest was only arithmetic. The steward who had found the house a second bench that morning, and a cushion for the Chancellor, went past the house's bench three times in the next hour and found something to do further along each time. Two of the correspondents who had come in for the exhibition picked up their boards and went out by the street door, not long after the officer, and did not come back. When the Current girl took the second touch of her bout off a curve that should have brought the whole north side up, the north side applauded sitting down, for about as long as was polite.
