editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md:683:- CALENDAR: the road meet was POSTPONED eight days by the confluence hall (river repairs; the river lifted the south-west planks — the false quarter) from day 63 to DAY 71. This supersedes the M3 ledger's "day 63" as the meet date (the M3 page — eighteen days on day 45, nine on day 54 — stays true as the original schedule). Chain: day-68 council; day-71 meet; the 23-day sealed-letter interval; day-75 sitting; day-76 gate.
